<title>JAPAN: MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 125CC RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-JAPANESE GRAND PRIX 125CC RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>SUZUKA, Japan 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the Japanese</p>
<p>Grand Prix 125cc category on Sunday:</p>
<p>Race distance: 18 laps, 105.552 km</p>
<p>1. Noboru Ueda (Japan) Honda  41 minutes 48.072 seconds</p>
<p>  2. Kazuto Sakata (Japan) Aprilia    41:48.437</p>
<p>  3. Hideyuki Nakajo (Japan) Honda    41:48.578</p>
<p>  4. Masao Azuma (Japan) Honda	  41:50.226</p>
<p>  5. Jorge Martinez (Spain) Aprilia   41:50.228</p>
<p>  6. Yoshiaki Katoh (Japan) Yamaha    41:50.326</p>
<p>  7. Garry McCoy (Australia) Aprilia  41:53.952</p>
<p>  8. Kazuhiro Takao (Japan) Honda     41:57.303</p>
<p>  9. Gianluigi Scalvini (Italy) Honda 42:10.290</p>
<p> 10. Frederic Petit (France) Honda    42:10.356</p>
